<title>USA: Sachse, Texas, won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Sachse, Texas, won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said it won $1.140 million of Sachse, Texas, combination tax and revenue limited tax certificates of obligation, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.435 percent.</p>
</text>
